// How to setup Breach gamemode?
// Copy Breach gamemode from Tools folder and move to preferred folder
// Now setup script for example: script preferred/breach.as
//
// Available commands:
// hostname - Server hostname
// port - Server port
// chat - Allow players to chat
// corpsealivetime - dead bodies removal time in seconds (may cause perfomance issues if too high).
// timeout - player timeout connection loss kick in seconds
// maxplayers - 60 is VERY recommended due to MTU limit (some players may lose data if more than 60)
// adminpassword - password for console allow, empty - disabled. Use /logadmin
// console - allow console for everybody
// voicebitrate - KBit/s, lower value will reduce network eating but quality will be bad, 0 - auto, 255 - max
// mapseed - empty string - random seed
// difficulty - 0 - safe, 1 - euclid, 2 - keter, 3 - apollyon
// gamemode - Gamemode name in server list
// emptybehaviour - 0 - restart server and waiting for players, 1 - pause and waiting for players, 2 - without pause and restart, 0 not recommended
// scriptsautoload - Load scripts from scripts\autoload folder
// disablenpcs - Disable NPCs and relatives events
// proximityplayers - the players will see the players at that distance
// mapbounds - the bounds of map (player XYZ can't go through this value)
// respawntime - respawn time in seconds. 0 - disable auto-respawn,
// contenturl - The server content URL
// password
// improvedgates - Enable doubled gates
// mapsize - 6-28 is allowed. 21 is default. (small - 12) (medium - 16) (big - 22) With small map sizes it is very possible for important rooms to not appear, so keep this in mind when shrinking the map.
// masterserver - Port for Steam master server. (65535 using main server port, so its recommended to not change this). Set 0 to disable
// description - available formats: &c[r g b], &c[hex], &r or &w - white, &i[imagefilename], &hl[link,underlined]: Example: &c[255 0 0]Ser&c[FF0000FF]ver. &hl[https://google.com,1]CLICKABLE
// allowjump - Allow jumps
// fastslots - Enable hot slots
// gravity - Gravity multiplier. Default is 1.0
// script - Load scripts from filename (You can use this command few times)
// plugin - Load plugin from filename (You can use this command few times)